---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What House Designer collects on buildmy.house: anonymous usage analytics through Google Analytics, and nothing else on this marketing site."
>
  <section class="page legal">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>This policy covers the marketing site at buildmy.house. It explains what we collect when you visit and why.</p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>This site uses Google Analytics (measurement ID <code>G-D655186TKF</code>), a service of Google LLC, to understand which pages are visited and how people find the site. Google Analytics sets cookies and collects usage data such as pages viewed, approximate location, browser and device type, and referring site. We use it only to improve the site.</p>
    <p>You can opt out with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>, or by blocking cookies and trackers in your browser.</p>

    <h2>What we do not collect here</h2>
    <p>The marketing site has no accounts, no sign-up forms and no advertising. We do not sell personal data.</p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>If you write to <a href="mailto:hello@buildmy.house">hello@buildmy.house</a>, we receive your email address and message and use them only to reply.</p>

    <h2>The app</h2>
    <p>The design tool at <a href="https://app.buildmy.house">app.buildmy.house</a> is a separate service and may handle data differently.</p>

    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy; the current version is always on this page. Questions can go to <a href="mailto:hello@buildmy.house">hello@buildmy.house</a> or the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem); }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 40px 0 12px; }
  .legal p { margin-bottom: 14px; max-width: 70ch; }
</style>
